OL,3,GNEWSAThird case of bird flu found in   
OL,4,Acommercial poultry                     
OL,6,FA third case of highly pathogenic bird 
OL,7,Fflu has been confirmed in commercial   
OL,8,Fpoultry in Norfolk, less than two weeks
OL,9,Fafter the first was recorded.          
OL,11,FThe Department for Environment, Food   
OL,12,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) said the H5N1
OL,13,Fvirus had been found near Dereham in   
OL,14,Fthe Breckland area on Saturday.        
OL,16,FIt comes after a case was reported in  
OL,17,Fthe same area on 12 November and       
OL,18,Fanother in Dersingham in the west of   
OL,19,Fthe county on 9 November.              
