OL,3,GNEWSAThird case of bird flu found in   
OL,4,Acommercial poultry                     
OL,6,FAs was the case on those occasions, a  
OL,7,F1.9 mile (3km) protection zone and 6.2 
OL,8,Fmile (10km) surveillance zone have been
OL,9,Fput in place around the latest premises
OL,10,Fand all poultry will be humanely       
OL,11,Fculled.                                
